.TH clearhead 1  "clearhead 0.2.1" 
.SH NAME
clearhead \- A CLI tool and library for working with the clearhead framework
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBclearhead\fR [\fB\-c\fR|\fB\-\-config\fR] [\fB\-d\fR|\fB\-\-debug\fR]... [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
A CLI tool and library for working with the clearhead framework
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-c\fR, \fB\-\-config\fR \fI<FILE>\fR
Sets a custom config file
.TP
\fB\-d\fR, \fB\-\-debug\fR
Turn debugging information on
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
clearhead\-read(1)
Read and list items (plans, actions, charters)
.TP
clearhead\-show(1)
Show details of a single item
.TP
clearhead\-add(1)
Add a new item
.TP
clearhead\-update(1)
Update an existing item
.TP
clearhead\-complete(1)
Mark an item as completed
.TP
clearhead\-delete(1)
Delete an item
.TP
clearhead\-format(1)
Format a file
.TP
clearhead\-lint(1)
Lint a file for errors and warnings
.TP
clearhead\-normalize(1)
Normalize a file (ensure UUIDs, format)
.TP
clearhead\-patch(1)
Apply changes from a patch file
.TP
clearhead\-archive(1)
Archive completed items
.TP
clearhead\-export(1)
Export items to external formats
.TP
clearhead\-import(1)
Import external formats into canonical workspace storage
.TP
clearhead\-expand(1)
Expand schedule plans into Action instances
.TP
clearhead\-cancel(1)
Cancel an item (sets state to Cancelled without deleting)
.TP
clearhead\-apply(1)
Apply a template or pattern to a charter
.TP
clearhead\-start(1)
Start a service
.TP
clearhead\-sync(1)
Synchronize data with external systems
.TP
clearhead\-query(1)
Execute SPARQL queries against the workspace RDF graph
.TP
clearhead\-debug(1)
Show resolved config and workspace diagnostics
.TP
clearhead\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
.SH VERSION
v0.2.1
